OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's SEND debt to be 90%
OL,4,Awiped out by #29m grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is to have 90% of its special
OL,7,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,8,F(SEND) debt "wiped out" with #29m of
OL,9,Fgovernment support.
OL,11,FBracknell Forest Council in Berkshire
OL,12,Fhas been accruing a deficit on its
OL,13,FDedicated Schools Grant since 2019.
OL,15,FThe authority will receive a High Needs
OL,16,FStability Grant that will cover the
OL,17,Fdeficit accumulated up until March
OL,18,F2026.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
