OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's SEND debt to be 90%
OL,4,Awiped out by #29m grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows government approval of the
OL,7,Fauthority's SEND reform plan and is in
OL,8,Faddition to #9m received through the
OL,9,FSafety Valve programme.
